\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The envelope family. The structure is a \emph  {branching}, not a hierarchy: both mixing and information relax the master TV envelope, in incomparable directions (Proposition~\ref {prop:incomp}), and the bit budget further relaxes the information branch via $I(X;Y)\le H(Y)$: $\text  {TV} \rightarrow \{\ \text  {mixing};\ \ \text  {information} \rightarrow \text  {bit budget}\ \}$. Each branch trades knowledge for tightness in its own currency; the battery of \S  \ref {sec:battery} measures the first three on real processes.}}{7}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:envelopes}{{2}{7}{The envelope family. The structure is a \emph {branching}, not a hierarchy: both mixing and information relax the master TV envelope, in incomparable directions (Proposition~\ref {prop:incomp}), and the bit budget further relaxes the information branch via $I(X;Y)\le H(Y)$: $\text {TV} \rightarrow \{\ \text {mixing};\ \ \text {information} \rightarrow \text {bit budget}\ \}$. Each branch trades knowledge for tightness in its own currency; the battery of \S \ref {sec:battery} measures the first three on real processes}{table.2}{}}
